{"texte":"Ein Supervulkan schläft unter dem Yellowstone. Würde er erwachen, passiert Folgendes, Minute für Minute. In den ersten Minuten rasen Wolken aus glühender Asche heran, schneller als ein Auto. Wer im Umkreis von Dutzenden Kilometern ist, hätte keine Chance. Binnen einer Stunde schießt eine Aschesäule über 30 Kilometer hoch. Danach fällt tagelang Asche auf große Teile Nordamerikas. Genug, um Dächer einzudrücken und Flugzeuge am Boden zu halten. Nach wenigen Wochen legt Schwefelgas einen Schleier über die Sonne, auf dem ganzen Planeten. Jahrelang wird es weltweit ein paar Grad kälter. Ein vulkanischer Winter. Die Ernten fallen aus, und die ganze Welt könnte hungern. Klingt verrückt? 1816 brachte der viel kleinere Tambora schon ein Jahr ohne Sommer. Die gute Nachricht? Am Yellowstone liegt der letzte Superausbruch 640.000 Jahre zurück, und Forscher sehen kein Zeichen für den nächsten.","caracteres":["E","i","n"," ","S","u","p","e","r","v","u","l","k","a","n"," ","s","c","h","l","ä","f","t"," ","u","n","t","e","r"," ","d","e","m"," ","Y","e","l","l","o","w","s","t","o","n","e","."," ","W","ü","r","d","e"," ","e","r"," ","e","r","w","a","c","h","e","n",","," ","p","a","s","s","i","e","r","t"," ","F","o","l","g","e","n","d","e","s",","," ","M","i","n","u","t","e"," ","f","ü","r"," ","M","i","n","u","t","e","."," ","I","n"," ","d","e","n"," ","e","r","s","t","e","n"," ","M","i","n","u","t","e","n"," ","r","a","s","e","n"," ","W","o","l","k","e","n"," ","a","u","s"," ","g","l","ü","h","e","n","d","e","r"," ","A","s","c","h","e"," ","h","e","r","a","n",","," ","s","c","h","n","e","l","l","e","r"," ","a","l","s"," ","e","i","n"," ","A","u","t","o","."," ","W","e","r"," ","i","m"," ","U","m","k","r","e","i","s"," ","v","o","n"," ","D","u","t","z","e","n","d","e","n"," ","K","i","l","o","m","e","t","e","r","n"," ","i","s","t",","," ","h","ä","t","t","e"," ","k","e","i","n","e"," ","C","h","a","n","c","e","."," ","B","i","n","n","e","n"," ","e","i","n","e","r"," ","S","t